{
  "uid": "data-platform-overview",
  "title": "批流一体数据平台 · 总览",
  "tags": ["data-platform", "sprint-11", "lakehouse"],
  "timezone": "Asia/Shanghai",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": { "from": "now-90d", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": ["10s", "30s", "1m", "5m", "15m", "1h"],
    "time_options": ["6h", "24h", "7d", "30d", "90d", "1y"]
  },
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "这个面板在看什么",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## 批流一体智能数据分析平台 · 数据治理总览\n\n**两套数据源，各自回答一个不同的问题：**\n\n| 数据源 | 回答的问题 | 覆盖面板 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `Doris (只读)` | **数据对不对**：离线 ADS 的 GMV/UV/PV/漏斗、逐窗口批流对账结论 | 业务数据区 |\n| `Prometheus` | **服务活不活**：Prometheus 抓取、Doris FE/BE 的查询与内存、Grafana 自身 | 监控区 |\n\n**时间范围默认 `now-90d`**：本机的数据由 `data-generator` 一次性生成，\n最新窗口在 **2026-09-26** 前后（约 25 小时前）。默认用 6h/24h 窗口会看到**空面板** ——\n那会让人误以为「面板做坏了」，而不是「数据本来就是历史数据」。\n\n**数据质量校验**（行数/主键/非空/枚举/层间一致/金额/新鲜度）在命令行：\n`bash scripts/run-quality-checks.sh`（失败会 `exit 1`）。本面板只做可视化，不做判定。"
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "一、数据新鲜度（离线 ADS 最新窗口 / 最新分区）",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "交易域最新窗口（ads_batch_trade_1m）",
      "description": "离线交易总览的最新分钟窗口。落后现在超过 26h 说明离线流水线至少漏跑了一整天（口径见 infrastructure/quality/checks.conf 第七节）",
      "datasource": { "type": "mysql", "uid": "doris-mysql" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT MAX(window_start) AS `最新交易窗口` FROM lakehouse_ads.ads_batch_trade_1m"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "dateTimeAsIso", "decimals": 0 }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "流量域最新窗口（ads_traffic_1m）",
